01:01:54,285 --> 01:02:00,285
It stars Christina Ricci, Thora Birch, Gaby Hoffmann, Ashleigh Aston Moore,
Melanie Griffith, Demi Moore, Rosie O'Donnell, and Rita Wilson.

14
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Its plot follows four women who recount a pivotal summer
they shared together as adolescents in 1970.

15
01:11:25,714 --> 01:11:31,714
Now and Then was filmed largely in the Country Walk subdivision off Coffee Bluff Road in Savannah, Georgia (called Shelby, Indiana, in the film, which itself
is based on the real-world town of Winchester, Indiana), using the Gaslight Addition and Old Town Cemetery, highlighting the downtown area.

16
01:16:11,428 --> 01:16:17,428
Additional filming was done in Statesboro, Georgia, in locations including the Bulloch
County Court House and the building now housing the Averitt Center for the Arts.

17
01:20:57,142 --> 01:21:03,142
Although the film received unfavorable reviews upon release, it was a box office
success, grossing $37.5 million against a $12 million budget.

18
01:25:42,857 --> 01:25:48,857
The film is considered a cult classic for its depiction of
girlhood and centering of female friendships.

19
